{
  "slug": "feature-dev",
  "name": "Feature Dev",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Comprehensive feature development workflow with specialized agents for codebase exploration, architecture design, and quality review",
  "longDescription": "Adds a `/feature-dev` command that orchestrates a **7-phase workflow** with **3 agents** (code-explorer, code-architect, code-reviewer):\n\n- **Discovery** → **Codebase exploration** → **Clarifying questions** → **Architecture design** → **Implementation** → **Quality review** → **Summary**\n\nExploration launches 2-3 agents targeting similar features, patterns, and conventions. Architecture compares minimal, clean, and pragmatic approaches. Review checks simplicity, correctness, and conventions.",
